B.ary=new A.d4("strategy-builder","Strategy Lab (Robot Builder)","Strategy Lab (Robot Builder)",B.hm,!0,!1,B.b0,"/strategy-lab",B.alK,B.I,!1,'COMERCIAL NA BRANCH DE DEV -- AINDA N\xc3O IMPLANTADO (INSIGHTVALUES-FINANCIAL-PRODUCT-MACRO-08): a Edge Function strategy-builder e TODAS as suas migrations (20261002000000 a 20261008000000) permanecem NOT DEPLOYED/LAB -- ausentes de .github/deploy-allowlist.tsv (Codex adversarial review confirmou). "COMERCIAL" aqui descrevia a arquitetura de entitlement/produto pronta dentro da branch isolada (autoriza\xe7\xe3o expl\xedcita do Macro-08) sob a premissa de que nenhum usu\xe1rio real alcan\xe7aria isto -- premissa invalidada pela Macro-13 (esta mesma branch foi implantada em produ\xe7\xe3o Web). Por isso commercialEnabled voltou a false (admin-only) at\xe9 uma decis\xe3o de Owner separada (Gate de produ\xe7\xe3o), fora do escopo aut\xf4nomo. Uma vez implantado: modelo gen\xe9rico de Strategy Specification, formul\xe1rio estruturado de cria\xe7\xe3o/edi\xe7\xe3o, backtest real (motor gen\xe9rico in-process ou ponte V10/Python), estat\xedsticas de mercado, ajuste estrat\xe9gia-mercado, motor de robustez, holdout cronol\xf3gico com rastreamento de contamina\xe7\xe3o, score multi-crit\xe9rio, propostas limitadas da IVE, loop de pesquisa automatizado (bounded), simula\xe7\xe3o interna determin\xedstica, cria\xe7\xe3o at\xf4mica (RPC transacional, Codex adversarial review). Estrat\xe9gia #001 (V10) permanece refer\xeancia de PESQUISA: reproduzida contra o dataset real WIN1! (75 trades, l\xedquido -R$57 sem custo / -R$270,75 com custo -- resultado hist\xf3rico NEGATIVO, divulgado honestamente, n\xe3o escondido). N\xc3O \xe9 estrat\xe9gia lucrativa comprovada, N\xc3O \xe9 aprovada para paper/live trading -- lifecycle.ts nunca autoriza isso automaticamente.','COMMERCIAL IN THE DEV BRANCH -- NOT YET DEPLOYED (INSIGHTVALUES-FINANCIAL-PRODUCT-MACRO-08): the strategy-builder Edge Function and ALL of its migrations (20261002000000 through 20261008000000) remain NOT DEPLOYED/LAB -- absent from .github/deploy-allowlist.tsv (confirmed by Codex adversarial review). "COMMERCIAL" here described the entitlement/product architecture as built inside the isolated dev branch (Macro-08\'s explicit authorization), on the premise that no real user could reach it -- a premise Macro-13 invalidated (this same branch was deployed to production Web). commercialEnabled was reverted to false (admin-only) pending a separate Owner production-gate decision, outside autonomous scope. Once deployed: generic Strategy Specification model, structured create/edit form, real backtest (in-process generic engine or the V10/Python bridge), market statistics, strategy-market fit, robustness engine, chronological holdout with contamination tracking, multi-criteria score, IVE bounded proposals, bounded automated research loop, deterministic internal simulation, atomic creation (transactional RPC, Codex adversarial review). Strategy #001 (V10) remains a RESEARCH reference: reproduced against the real WIN1! dataset (75 trades, net -R$57 zero-cost / -R$270.75 cost-adjusted -- a NEGATIVE historical result, disclosed honestly, not hidden). NOT a proven profitable strategy, NOT paper/live-trading approved -- lifecycle.ts never auto-authorizes that.','REVERSIBLE (servidor: module_policy.ts): configura\xe7\xe3o de estrat\xe9gia nunca executa nada por si s\xf3 (\xa714 do Macro-06 -- "configuration is not authorization"). Separado de ive-strategy-simulation (CONSEQUENTIAL, BETA/beta_tester) porque strategy-builder em si n\xe3o toca AEF -- s\xf3 a aprova\xe7\xe3o formal de um resultado de simula\xe7\xe3o toca. Estrat\xe9gia #001 permanece RESEARCH (lifecycle.ts nunca autoriza SIMULATION_ELIGIBLE/PAPER_ELIGIBLE/LIVE_ELIGIBLE). Tr\xeas rodadas de auditoria Codex Classe D sobre esta superf\xedcie (Macro-06 e Macro-07) fecharam com 0 P0/P1/P2 abertos antes desta promo\xe7\xe3o de lifecycle. ESCALA\xc7\xc3O ARQUITETURAL (Codex adversarial review, Macro-08 diff vs 15d4177): a fun\xe7\xe3o e suas migrations seguem NOT DEPLOYED -- decis\xe3o de implantar em produ\xe7\xe3o pertence ao Owner (Paulo/Agente Martins), nunca aut\xf4noma.',null)
